mixin NovelCard(item, index)
    div(class='novel-card')
        div(class='flex items-start')
            a(class='w-[120px] md:w-[158px] flex-shrink-0' href="novel_detail.html?id=1")
                div(class='aspect-w-11 aspect-h-16')
                    div( class='poster rounded-sm overflow-hidden pointer-events-auto')
                        img(class="w-full h-full rounded-sm group-hover:scale-125 transition-all" src='/static/frontend/images/loading.svg'  alt='poster')
                        div(class='w-full px-0.5 py-1 absolute left-0.5 top-0.5 flex group-hover:hidden' )
                            span(class='text-sm py-0.5 px-2  text-white rounded-large bg-primary mr-2') 原创
                            span(class='text-sm py-0.5 px-2 dx-bg-linear text-white rounded-large ') 连载中
                        div(class='w-full px-0.5 py-1 absolute left-1 bottom-5 flex group-hover:hidden' )
                            if index
                            div(class='px-0.5 py-1 absolute left-0 top-0 flex group-hover:hidden' )
                                div(class='bg-primary w-5 h-4.5 flex-center text-white text-sm rounded-[6px] rounded-bl-none rounded-tr-none')= index
            div(class='ml-1 md:ml-3 flex-1 overflow-hidden')
                div(class='dx-title w-full font-semibold mb-1') 
                    | 爆奸调教身材极品的高冷女神
                    span(class='text-sm ml-0.5 px-1 rounded text-primary border border-solid border-primary') 原创首发
                div(class='mb-1')
                    span 作者：
                    a(class='underline' href="novel_list.html?author=fishx") fishx
                div(class='flex items-center mb-1')
                    span 评分：
                    span(class='inline-flex items-center')
                        span(class='text-primary mr-1') 8.00
                        div(class='flex items-center')
                            svg(class='w-4 h-4')
                                use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#star_red')
                            svg(class='w-4 h-4')
                                use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#star_red')
                            svg(class='w-4 h-4')
                                use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#star_red')
                            svg(class='w-4 h-4')
                                use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#star_red')
                            svg(class='w-4 h-4')
                                use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#star_icon')
                div(class='line-clamp-1 mb-1')
                    span 题材：
                    a(class='underline mr-1' href="novel_list.html?theme=1") 都市激情
                    a(class='underline mr-1' href="novel_list.html?theme=2") 贤者小说
                    a(class='underline mr-1' href="novel_list.html?theme=3") 校园春色
                div(class='mb-1')
                    span 标签：
                    a(class='underline' href="video_list.html?tag=1") #弟妹 
                    a(class='underline' href="video_list.html?tag=2") #乱伦
                div(class='flex items-center text-sm mb-1')
                    | 最新：
                    span(class='max-w-[120px] truncate') 第120章 秦芸经历的生离死别
                    | （8小时前）
                div
                    span(class='mr-3') 232K
                    span(class='mr-3') 286K
                    span 26.22%(中肉)